# Terraform local/generated state — deploy/terraform/.gitignore covers this
# too once it exists on a given checkout, but that file only landed on
# ai-main so far (not yet promoted to main); this root-level copy protects
# every branch in the meantime, and any other deploy/**/terraform work later.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
nohup.out
